  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h4 class=\"title\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; font-size: 24px; font-family: Bevellier-Medium, 'Helvetic Neue', Helvetica, san-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(8, 97, 206);\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: italic;\">FLOW STATE. FLOW MIND. FLOW LIFE.</em></span></h4>\r\n<p class=\"lead\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 1.25rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 300; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Where Effort meets Ease.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Where Have To meets Get To.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Where Try Hard meets Try Well.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Where Do Meets Be.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Where Science meets Synergy.</p>\r\n<p class=\"lead\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 1.25rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 300; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Made with real ingredients for real life.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">We bring the pieces together.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">You make it move.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product Description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">A light and refreshing non-carbonated performance tea made with 100% plant-based ingredients designed to help you synergistically find your flow.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">100% all-natural and plant-based, Troov features:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 2rem; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">125 mg slow-release caffeine</strong>&nbsp;from all-natural brewed green tea for increased energy and focus.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">125 mg naturally occurring nitrates&nbsp;</strong>for optimal nitric oxide conversion to increase circulation (boost blood flow).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">2450mg L-Citrulline&nbsp;</strong>for increased strength and reduced muscle fatigue.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&gt;250mg polyphenols&nbsp;</strong>for optimal blood flow and anti-aging.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">35mg EGCG&nbsp;</strong>to prevent inflammation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: Montserrat, HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">1590mg maca root&nbsp;</strong>for improved stamina, strength, and mood.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">30 days after purchase&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our True Groove Movement Team is all about finding activities that put us in the present moment. Whether that's running the beach, hiking a mountain, lifting weights, surfing a wave, or diving into a creative pursuit... our team of ambassadors believes that this life is meant to be lived to the fullest, and the only way to get there is by pushing the boundaries of our individual limits while soaking up every minute of doing so. That's what Troov was designed to do... help you find your flow, wherever it may be.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We're currently accepting applications for those of you who feel called to the pursuit of living life on your on terms, pushing boundaries, and using 100% natural and clean fuel to help you do so.&nbsp;</p>",
